#18900
gatekeeper underworld~
the gatekeeper of the Underworld~
The Underworld's gatekeeper stands here.~
He has powerful muscles and a strange expression on his face.  You may
want to be careful with this man.  The decision is his whether to kill 
you or let you in.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_SMART|ACT_NO_ORDER|ACT_RACE
AFF_SANCTUARY|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_TONGUES
0 S
90 0 0 0d0+20000 1d10+80
109816 RACE_ELF
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>greet_prog 100~
look $n
if ispc($n)
  if class($n) == 6
  or class($n) == 2
    smile $n
  else
    shout Be gone $n!
    mpforce $n scream
    mptransfer $n 9755
  endif
endif
~
>speech_prog p let me in!~
say Welcome to the Underworld!
say Have a nice day.
mptransfer $n 18901
mpat 18901 mpforce $n look
~
>speech_prog p let us in!~
say Welcome to the Underworld!
say Have a nice day.
mptransfer pcs 18901
mpat 18901 mpforce all look
~
>fight_prog 20~
kick 
~
|
