sewer mad~
the mad sewer~
An old, mad sewer is here.~
The sewer is an old looking human. He appears to be meditating.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_SMART|ACT_NO_ORDER|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE
AFF_SANCTUARY|AFF_INFRARED|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_TONGUES
100 S
95 BODY_TORSO BODY_HEAD|BODY_ARM 10d100+10000 2d5+80
217691 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>greet_prog 100~
if ispc($n)
  emote opens his eyes and looks at you intently.
  if actorhasobjnum(18918)
    bow $n
  endif
~
>rand_prog 3~
yawn 
~
>fight_prog 20~
if rand(50)
  cast 'energy drain' $n
  cackle 
else
  emote concentrates.
  mass acid
endif
~
>death_prog 100~
shout AAARRRRRRRGGGGGHHHHH!!!!!!
~
>rand_prog 1~
mpjunk all
~
>speech_prog p make robe~
if hasobjnum(18909)
  if hasobjnum(18910)
    if hasobjnum(18911)
      mpjunk all
      emote concentrates deeply.
      emote begins sewing the items you have given him.
      mpoload 18900
      give robe $n
      sigh 
      say That is the best I can do with those supplies.
    else
      say You must give me the proper materials.
    endif
  else
    say You must give me the proper materials.
  endif
else
  say You must give me the proper materials.
endif
~
|
