hermit ashen~
the ashen hermit~
An ashen-faced hermit is here.~
This man is very hungry.  He prays that someone will give him some food.
The rogues and pirates have taken all of his food and possessions.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_SMART|ACT_NO_ORDER|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_SANCTUARY|AFF_INFRARED|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_TONGUES
