80 BODY_TORSO BODY_HEAD|BODY_LEG|BODY_HAND 10d50+4800 9d3+50
242305 RACE_HUMAN
POS_RESTING POS_RESTING SEX_MALE
>greet_prog 60~
look $n
say Hello traveler, can you give me some food?
sigh 
~
>rand_prog 2~
say I am so hungry.
cry 
mpjunk all
~
>give_prog I18919~
emote eats a loaf brown bread.
burp 
smile 
say Thank you so much.
bow $n
emote gets an ashen belt from a bag.
mpoload 18906
give belt $n
say Keep this belt.  It will bring you luck.
smile
say Do you think you help me?
say I've lost my talisman.
say Can you find it for me?
sigh 
say Without my talisman the Gods can't hear my prayers.
cry 
mpjunk all
~
>give_prog I18920~
smile $n
say Thank you traveler.
say I have something for you.
emote rummages in his bag.
emote gets the Shawl of the Wise from a bag.
mpoload 18905
give shawl $n
emote gets an old cowl from a bag.
mpoload 18907
give cowl $n
say I hope these things bring you a lot of luck.
smile 
mpjunk all
~
